    "detailed_description": "Sift Heads never dies; it evolves into legend. Dive into the timeless legacy of the Sift Heads series with this legendary collection. Immerse yourself in a captivating world of retro gaming, now optimized for full-screen PC gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962620/extras/db8717ebf0f717ac479af901fedabe0b.poster.avif?t=1717086848\" width=600 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962620/extras/db8717ebf0f717ac479af901fedabe0b.webm?t=1717086848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962620/extras/db8717ebf0f717ac479af901fedabe0b.mp4?t=1717086848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience the thrill of the hunt with Assassination Missions, where precision is paramount. Navigate through the shadows with Stealth Gameplay, mastering the art of deception. Engage with intricate Crime Storylines that will keep you on the edge of your seat.<br>Arm yourself with a vast Weapon Arsenal, each tool of the trade offering unique strategies for success. Delve into the depths of narrative with Cinematic Storytelling, where every mission unfolds like a blockbuster movie.<br><br>Engage in Immersive Gameplay that transports you into the heart of the action, where every decision shapes your destiny. Explore Interactive Environments, where your surroundings are more than just scenery; they're opportunities waiting to be seized.<br>Don't miss out on this quintessential collection of gaming history. Get your hands on the Sift Heads collection today and experience gaming like never before.<br><br>Features include:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Assassination Missions<br></li><li>Stealth Gameplay<br></li><li>Engaging Crime Storylines<br></li><li>Vast Weapon Arsenal<br></li><li>Cinematic S